<p>Hi <%= @member.name.split.first %>,</p>

<p>Thank you — we've recorded your availability to meet with another woman in your group. We're so glad you're taking part!</p>

<p>Here's what you shared:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Topic:</strong> <%= @topic&.name || "—" %></li>
  <% @window_labels.each_with_index do |label, index| %>
    <li><strong>Window <%= index + 1 %>:</strong> <%= label %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<% if @can_edit && @response_url.present? %>
  <p>
    You can change your answers until the round closes:
    <a href="<%= @response_url %>">Update my availability</a>
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>If someone chose the same topic and time as you, we'll introduce you by email and leave it to you to connect. We're certain it's a conversation you'll both enjoy.</p>

<p>After you have made your connection, let us know how it went!</p>

<p>Love,<br>— WE Team</p>
